WEBVTT

00:05:28.115 --> 00:05:30.993
It is a threat
to disadvantaged communities.

00:05:30.993 --> 00:05:33.746
I mean, the coal pollution
from burning fossil fuels

00:05:33.788 --> 00:05:36.957
kills nine million people every year.

00:05:36.999 --> 00:05:40.753
A large multiple of the number
of people killed by COVID

00:05:40.795 --> 00:05:44.173
are killed annually
by the particulate pollution

00:05:44.215 --> 00:05:46.801
that comes from fossil fuels.

00:05:46.842 --> 00:05:48.260
We can save money,

00:05:48.302 --> 00:05:50.304
we can fight inflation, by the way.

00:05:50.805 --> 00:05:52.890
The sustainability revolution,

00:05:52.932 --> 00:05:56.435
including renewable energy,
is massively deflationary.

00:05:56.477 --> 00:05:58.729
The cost continues to go down.

00:05:59.188 --> 00:06:02.191
There are multiple reasons
why we should see this